('av__caIk3EDcJkOZ3j7IZbtqJURLlZBsQB4iJaNVfWkZMLS8UN9jQEb0zaih1E8oSEkAWkVMlAkMWou-eE','猫和老鼠 第3季',2019,'anime','美国','英语','["欧美动漫","喜剧","动漫","家庭","儿童"]','["Jerry","Tom","Jake D. Smith","D.","Jake","Smith","JakeD.Smith","道斯·巴特勒","里德·科菲","特克斯·艾弗里","威廉·汉纳","约瑟夫·巴伯拉"]','["史派克·布兰特","T·J·House","Tony Cervone","Cervone","Tony","TonyCervone","达雷尔·范·西特斯","迈克尔·拉赫"]','https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=webp&src=img.baipiaozhe.com/assets/images/f3/f37b8fa0a84859c7cb8d18254d7f53ad4085e5ee2c07222fea78968802092272.webp',NULL,'The iconic cat and mouse rivals are back in The Tom and Jerry Show, a fresh take on the classic series. Preserving the look, characters and sensibility of the original, the all-new series shines a brightly colored, high-definition lens on the madcap slapstick and never-ending battle that has made Tom and Jerry two of the most beloved characters of all time.汤姆和杰瑞回来了!《猫和老鼠2014》第三季开播,不仅保留了猫和老鼠旧版经典的打闹场景,还添加了许多新场景:恶魔村,豪宅。猫和老鼠的爆笑幽默打斗故事将会呈现在观众的眼前。','全24集',24,24,73.21,'最近更新 第24集'),
('av__crhpArkpJAj3NTPEEnQGca9oQSuBC6jyg9hFs-mGpdZc_uqOqbZLuOXNSS8tp-beIyS8j0aeyQYAJw','中餐厅 第6季',2022,'variety','中国大陆','国语','["大陆综艺","真人秀","综艺"]','["黄晓明","尹正","陈立农","殷桃","章若楠","林述巍","姜妍","翟潇闻","王俊凯","丁禹兮","沈月","尹浩宇"]','["刘利辉","王恬","刘力辉","祁扬","孙恺凯","王晶","王恬刘力辉","谢铜"]','https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=webp&src=img.baipiaozhe.com/assets/images/4d/4d4a68fd0532f19f446cd81df2907b6dc13619bbfa57197fffab1ec5f957bdaf.webp','https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=webp&src=img.baipiaozhe.com/assets/images/f6/f64037f9a3a2b3b792740e91efa37a8692d9221e512c30b49436ceb560964bd6.webp','《中餐厅》第十年,将在“南洋拾光”的氛围中,打造一家独具风格特色的田园餐厅。内容场景上,除餐厅本体外,还将设置家禽、鲜蔬、河鲜等不同餐厅区域,合伙人需要开拓经营思路,完成经营目标;此外,餐厅还将引入“主厨餐桌”、“大厨到家”等新颖模式,让中餐与世界、厨师与食客、文化与生活之间实现真正的彼此走进。','2022-11-20',64,64,77.09,NULL),
